<title>USA: Anaheim, Calif., $514 mln repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Anaheim, Calif., $514 mln repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Tuesday it repriced Anaheim Public Financing Authority, Calif.'s $514 million lease revenue bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>ANAHEIM PUBLIC FINANCING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $513,828,820.20*</p>
<p>LEASE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(ANAHEIM PUBLIC IMPROVEMENT PROJECT)</p>
<p>1997 SERIES A, B, &amp; C</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING AND RESTRUCTURING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>					    236,250,000*</p>
<p>					    SENIOR LEASE</p>
<p>					   REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>					   1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa/Baa2	  S&amp;P: AAA/BBB	   FITCH: NR / BBB+</p>
<p>	   (COND.)		  (PROV.)</p>
<p>FSA INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 02/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 09/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 03/01 &amp; 09/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>09/01/2024	     34,500M    6.00  %	  5.60</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 105.579)</p>
<p>09/01/2027	     32,900M    5.00  %	  5.73</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 89.524)</p>
<p>03/01/2037	    168,850M    5.00  %	  5.80</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 87.6  )</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 09/01/2007    101.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 09/01/2009</p>
<p>09/01/2024A:   NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
</text>
